@cc [owner:flvndvd,label:product] legacy-opacity-overrides-are-opt-in
Generated opacity color overrides MUST target an element carrying an inventoried legacy opacity
class. For dividers, that class belongs to the parent; for placeholders, to the pseudo-element owner.
They MUST NOT replace ordinary V4 color utility declarations globally.

@cc [owner:flvndvd,label:testing] css-audit-is-not-visual-equivalence
Audit outputs MUST distinguish textual rule differences from browser behavior, and MUST state the
compiled vocabulary and tested browser/fixture scope. Matching text MUST NOT be described as proof
of unchanged Frames.
